Package: opencodex
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: yorkane <yorkane@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: net
Priority: optional
Depends: nodejs (>= 20), xvfb, adduser, ca-certificates
Homepage: https://github.com/yorkane/OpenCodex
Description: OpenCodex gateway and launcher
 OpenCodex is a middleware layer that exposes a machine's Codex Desktop
 runtime through a browser, so a phone, tablet or another computer can drive
 the same Codex session over the LAN or a tunnel.
 .
 This package installs the gateway, the web shell and the bundled patches
 (site branding, outbound host policy, headless Electron flags), registers
 the Xvfb virtual display and the gateway systemd services, and provides the
 opencodex launcher for starting, stopping and opening the web UI.
 .
 The official Codex Desktop runtime must be installed separately; point
 CODEX_DESKTOP_APP_PATH / CODEX_DESKTOP_EXECUTABLE_PATH in
 /etc/opencodex/gateway.env at it.
